Title:  Version 19.6.0

Seq:    13.1

Level:  3 - chapter

Class:  version

Date:   2026-09-04

Teaser:

Fixed a problem that sometimes prevented a request to open a Collection from making use of an existing Window in which the Collection was already open; Also added an option to filter search results, so that only the matching Notes show up in the List tab. 

Timestamp: 20260901001408

Body:

##### Fixed Window Reuse Problem

When a user requests a Collection to be opened, and it is already open in an existing window, Notenik will generally bring that window forward rather than opening a second window for the same Collection. However, this was not working when a user opened a Collection, then closed it, then issued multiple subsequent requests to open it. This has been fixed.

##### Added a Filtered Search Option

Added a new command beneath the *Nav* menu to *Search and Filter*.  See the [[Search]] page for instructions on how this can be used.
